---
title: Backpressure Logic – Semaphore + Policies
---

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> CheckSemaphore

    CheckSemaphore --> NoLimit: semaphore == null
    CheckSemaphore --> TryAcquire: semaphore configured

    NoLimit --> Serialize

    TryAcquire --> Serialize: permit granted
    TryAcquire --> CheckPolicy: no permit

    CheckPolicy --> Block: BLOCK (default)
    CheckPolicy --> FastFail: FAST_FAIL

    state Block {
        [*] --> Waiting
        Waiting --> Acquired: permit free
    }

    FastFail --> ErrorCallback: errorCallback(event)
    FastFail --> FailedFuture: return failedFuture

    ErrorCallback --> FailedFuture
    FailedFuture --> [*]

    Block --> Serialize
    Acquired --> Serialize

    Serialize --> SubmitAsync: JSON ok
    Serialize --> ReleaseOnError: JSON error

    ReleaseOnError --> FailedFuture

    SubmitAsync --> Running: accepted by executor
    SubmitAsync --> ReleaseOnError: rejected

    Running --> ReleasePermit: INSERT done
    Running --> ReleasePermit: SQL error

    ReleasePermit --> CompletedFuture
    CompletedFuture --> [*]
